Subject: [PATCH] ARM: configs: multi_v7_addons: fix display part for stm32mp1

Update drivers to set all of them as module drivers except DRM & SIMPLEDRM.

Change-Id: Ia6e9363002b5d42a150a93616f08463dd2c80be6
Signed-off-by: Yannick Fertre <yannick.fertre@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/498338
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 .../configs/fragment-02-multiv7_addons.config   | 17 +++++------------
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/configs/fragment-02-multiv7_addons.config b/arch/arm/configs/fragment-02-multiv7_addons.config
index 855b8c59b298..47f62fe187ce 100644
--- a/arch/arm/configs/fragment-02-multiv7_addons.config
+++ b/arch/arm/configs/fragment-02-multiv7_addons.config
@@ -3,7 +3,8 @@ CONFIG_AEABI=y
 CONFIG_ARCH_FORCE_MAX_ORDER=12
